  "sourceTitle": "Hot Mango Chutney Dip",
  "sourceText": "Hot Mango Chutney Dip\nBy: Kevin Tu\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup (8-ounce) container) sour cream\n1/2 cup Hot Mango Chutney\n2 tablespoons finely chopped cilantro\n1/4 teaspoon curry powder\n1/8 teaspoon salt\nAssorted fresh vegetables for dipping\n\nPreparation\n\n1 COMBINE sour cream, chutney, salt and curry powder in medium bowl. 2 Refrigerate for 1 hour. Serve with vegetables.",
